# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl1-chargers (test/README.md): texture alternates of brush entities
# (docs/specs/world-surfaces.md 4: entity frame != 0 shows the '+a'
# sequence). hldemo1's wall chargers by the NRC corridor: the HEV charger
# (func_recharge *52, +0recharge) drained with +use until its 75 juice is
# gone (CRecharge sets frame 1: +arecharge); then the health charger beside
# it (func_healthcharger *51, +0medkit) in use: the player is at full
# health, so it keeps its juice and frame 0 (GoldSrc shows no texture
# change while a charger is in use). Shots: both full, HEV empty, health in
# use. Not a window of uplink.route (the route uses neither charger).
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 60
setpos -2048 744 36
wait 2
stats begin
setpos -1400 -424 36 0 0
wait 1
shot chargers-full
setpos -1360 -456 36 0 0
+use
wait 14
-use
setpos -1400 -424 36 0 0
wait 0.5
shot hev-empty
setpos -1360 -392 36 0 0
+use
wait 1.5
shot health-inuse
-use
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
